<title>UK: Lehman sets $50 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets $50 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Lehman.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDINGS PLC</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    01.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +30 BP    PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A	   ISS PRICE  99.828    LISTING     LONDON</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BAA1</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
